  "title": "A Low-Cost LED-LDR portable colorimeter-multimeter (LED-LDR PCM) for analytical laboratories in Iraq: An educational of deviation from the beer-lambert law and green chemistry approach",
  "author": "Waheb, Abbas, et al.",
  "doi": "10.1016/j.mex.2026.103881",
